--- LƯỢT 1 ---
Spec Valid: True | Verified: False
Error Taxonomy: PostconditionViolation
Error Message: [PostconditionViolation] tại Dòng 5, Cột 0: a postcondition could not be proved on this return path
Code:
method is_prime(k: int) returns (result: bool)
  requires k >= 1
  ensures result ==> forall i :: 2 <= i < k ==> k % i != 0
  ensures (k > 1 && !result) ==> exists j :: 2 <= j < k && k % j == 0
{
  result := true;
  if k <= 1 {
    result := false;
  } else {
    var i: int := 2;
    while i * i <= k
      invariant 2 <= i <= k
      decreases k - i
    {
      if k % i == 0 {
        result := false;
        break;
      }
      i := i + 1;
    }
  }
}

